1. In this task, work with the time index \tau = 1,2,...,\Tau, representing months. Load the three Chen and Zimmermann (2022) signal datasets:
1）Q3_Datasets/Mom12m.csv: define (MOMCZ=Mom12m).
2）Q3_Datasets/BMdec.csv: define (BMCZ=BMdec).
3） Q3_Datasets/GP.csv: define (GPCZ=GP).
Merge the three datasets by stock identifier (permno) and month (yyyymm). Use only these CZ signals for portfolio formation.

2. Use "Q3_Datasets/CRSP_monthly.csv" for stock returns and market equity. Focus on the period from June of 1963 to the recent date. Restrict the analysis to common stocks of firms incorporated in the United States (CRSP shrcd = 10 or 11) trading on NYSE, Amex, or Nasdaq (CRSP exchcd =
